  "goodToKnow": "Agieren means to act or operate, and it stresses taking the initiative: Wir müssen agieren, nicht nur reagieren. It's common in business and politics: Das Unternehmen agiert international. Actors on stage don't agieren: they spielen a role. Der Akteur is anyone who acts in a field, so politicians, companies and players are all Akteure. The -ieren ending means no ge- in the participle: agiert."
